<reference id="bacnet-JettyScWebSocketInitiator" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Web Socket Initiator (bacnet-JettyScWebSocketInitiator)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component supports the port link function.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">bacnet-JettyScWebSocketInitiator</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">Web Socket Initiator properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" scope="local" width="700" href="../graphic/propertiesWebSockedInitiator_0000089207.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Comm</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Network</uicontrol></menucascade>, then expand either <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ScHubPort</uicontrol> or <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">ScPort</uicontrol>, expand Link and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Web Socket Initiator</uicontrol>.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Perform Hostname Validation</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "><option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option> or <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">false</option> (default)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Enables verification that the DNS name in the <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">subjectAltName</parmname> field of the server certificate matches
the host portion of the URL used to make the request.</propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>